cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ganjoor: An Open, Citable Archive of Classical Persian Poetry"
abstract: >-
  A schema-documented, MIT/CC-BY-licensed republication of the
  ganjoor.net Persian poetry corpus, with a reference Progressive
  Web App reader. The project aims to provide stable, citable
  infrastructure for any downstream Persian poetry application
  or scholarly work.
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: sajad2025
    affiliation: "Independent"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sajad2025/ganjoor"
url: "https://sajad2025.github.io/ganjoor/"
keywords:
  - persian poetry
  - hafez
  - digital humanities
  - cultural heritage
  - open data
  - rtl
  - farsi
  - شعر پارسی
  - گنجور
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-18"
references:
