    title: "Ganjoor (source corpus)"
    authors:
      - family-names: Hadianfard
        given-names: Habib
    url: "https://ganjoor.net"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/ganjoor/GanjoorService"
    notes: >-
      Primary upstream source of the corpus. This project is an
      independent republication; editorial credit for the underlying
      texts belongs to ganjoor.net and its contributors.
